 r/data/1181412/000162828026042639/spaceexplorationtechnologi.htm\nhttps://
 ir.spacex.com/updates/releases-details/2026/SpaceX-to-Post-Third-Quarter-2
 026-Results-and-Host-Webcast-on-October-20-2026-2026-QssQGye3im/default.as
