BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:starship-15@superchargeddaily.com
DTSTAMP:20261109T075559Z
DTSTART:20261113T224500Z
DTEND:20261114T000000Z
SUMMARY:[Target] Starship Flight 15
DESCRIPTION:Provisional target\nSpaceX is targeting Flight 15 as soon as Fr
 iday 13 November from Pad 2\, pending regulatory approval. The 75-minute w
 indow opens at 4:45 p.m. CT (22:45 UTC). Planned: first Super Heavy V3 cat
 ch\, first Ship return-to-launch-site catch\, 26 Starlink V3\, then a more
  than 22-hour flight before a Ship catch. This is a published window\, not
  a guaranteed T-0. No FAA licence is published.\nhttps://www.spacex.com/la
 unches/starship-flight-15\nhttps://www.spacex.com/updates\nhttps://starshi
 p-spacex.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Flight_15\nhttps://compass.atfm.aero/pub
 lic_svcdynamic/getfile?download=false&fileuuid=0fb6079b-6d10-4039-8766-b3c
 cb3c877f0\nhttps://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/20/space
 x-spcx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/\nhttps://x.com/SpaceX/status/2114
 444137067844004\nhttps://www.nextspaceflight.com/starship/hardware/80/
LOCATION:Starbase · Pad 2
URL:https://superchargeddaily.com/calendar.html?event=starship-15
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
